# This file pins the prebuilt libvips release that the Windows vips jobs may
# consume instead of the upstream libvips/build-win64-mxe zip.
#
# The value must be the tag of a GitHub Release in this repository produced by
# the `Prebuild libvips` workflow (.github/workflows/prebuild-vips.yml). That
# release carries vips-windows-<arch>.zip: a bundled libvips (bin/ layout) with
# PDFium linked in and without GPL poppler/fftw.
#
# Format: vips-YYYYMMDD-<shortSha>
# Example: vips-20260927-abcdef0
#
# Empty (the default) means: keep consuming the upstream MXE zip. Do not set
# this until a prebuild run has produced a validated asset.
